  "description": "Pipeline timing from the pipeline containers' stdout in VictoriaLogs (instance=prod-podcast, surface=pipeline; Alloy ships docker logs). Every panel reads the `episode_metrics:` lines from `orchestration._log_episode_metrics` (key=value fields audio_sec, transcribe_sec, summary_sec, retries, rate_limit_sleep_sec, prompt_tokens, completion_tokens, estimated_cost; `null` values are filtered out) or the `Starting multi-feed podcast scrape` line. Series are grouped by `surface` because container names are per-run. The earlier JSONL echo row (run_started / episode_finished / run_finished from jsonl_metrics_echo_stdout, GH-746) was removed: no prod profile enables it and VictoriaLogs holds no such line. HTTP `/metrics` on the api container stays Prometheus-only.",
